=== DEMO 4 (Anh A04): Ca tu thiet ke 2: Xu ly gia tri am va so 0 trong [-1000, 1000] ===
=================================================================
Nap chuoi gia tri chua so am, so 0 va bien: [-500, 0, 1000, -999]
  + them!(-500) -> dau=-500, cuoi=-500, n=1
  + them!(0) -> dau=-500, cuoi=0, n=2
  + them!(1000) -> dau=-500, cuoi=1000, n=3
  + them!(-999) -> dau=-500, cuoi=-999, n=4
=== Hang doi sau khi nap day du ===
So luong n: 4
  dau  (head) --> Node(-500)
  cuoi (tail) --> Node(-999)
  Chuoi lien ket: [-500] -> [0] -> [1000] -> [-999] -> nothing
  Bat bien hop le: true

Tien hanh lay lan luot tat ca cac phan tu:
Ket qua lay ra:  [-500, 0, 1000, -999]
Ky vong ban dau: [-500, 0, 1000, -999]
So khop FIFO:    DUNG (Chinh xac 100%)
Trang thai cuoi: dau=nothing, cuoi=nothing, la_rong=true

